\date{2026-10-31T05:20:05Z}
\title{Subobject inclusion relation}
\taxon{Definition}
\author{hsuchingchung}
\import{macros-subobj}

\p{

For [monomorphisms](0006) #{u, v} into the same object #{A} in a category \CCat, we say #{u} is \strong{included} in #{v}, denoted by #{u \le v}, if

##{x \in u \text{ implies } x \in v}

for all [generalized elements](0002) #{x} of #{A}. Recall that #{x \in u} denotes the [subobject membership relation](0007).}